|H_T| \geq |S \cap B_T| \geq |S \cap C| \geq k^d = \left ( \frac{T}{\sqrt{d}R} - \frac{q}{2R}  \right )^d
% = \Omega(T^d).
$$
and hence $\liminf _{T \to \infty} \frac{|H_T|}{T^d} > 0$.




