  Both $c_1$ and $c_2$ are periodic, that is, annihilated by non-trivial difference $\R$-polynomials. 
  More precisely, $c_1$ is annihilated by $x - 1$ and $c_2$ is annihilated by $x^{\alpha} - 1$. 
