\KwOutput{$G_i$: an $\s$-Gr\"{o}bner basis of the left ideal $I_j$ generated by $\{\mathfrak{f}_1,\cdots,\mathfrak{f}_j\}$\\
\qquad\quad~ \ $S$~: leading terms of syzygies
