As shown in Table \ref{tab:COMPARISON_results}, we compare our proposed OCDGALP-based system with the latest systems in the literature on the DIHARD III dataset. To ensure a fair evaluation, we adhere to the same conditions specified in the original challenge: no collar tolerance is applied, and overlapping speech is considered.

