        $g_n^{11}$ & (RMS of acceleration $a_{\text{RMS}}$) / $|a|_{\text{max}}$ & $g_n^{28}$ & (Average acceleration $\overline{|a|}$) \\
        $g_n^{12}$ & Median of the segment & $g_n^{29}$ & Maximum of the segment \\
        $g_n^{13}$ & Standard deviation of velocity $\sigma_v$ & $g_n^{30}$ & Minimum of the segment \\
        $g_n^{14}$ & Standard deviation of acceleration $\sigma_a$ & $g_n^{31}$ & Skewness of x \\
        $g_n^{15}$ & Jerk $|j|$ & $g_n^{32}$ & Kurtosis of x \\
        $g_n^{16}$ & Average jerk & $g_n^{33}$ & Learner's gender \\
