        \hline \hline
        Attention     & SVM (linear kernel) with PCA and smoothing window of size 20 & 64\% \\
        \hline
        Heart Rate (HR)         & SVM (Gaussian kernel) with a subset of 40 features and smoothing window of size 5  & 70\% \\
