  \includegraphics[width=0.6\textwidth]{media/IndeX_artifacts.jpg}
  \caption{Popping/Jumping artifacts we encountered with Paraview's IndeX plugin if the data size approaches the GPU's VRAM. They look like an improperly sampled volume texture that serves as a cache for streamed-in tiles.}
