\section{Experiments}
\label{sec:exp_res}

In this section, we evaluate the effectiveness of STDL on image classification (Section~\ref{sec:static_image_exp}) and event-based vision recognition (Section~\ref{sec:event_exp}). Then, we provide ablation studies and analytical results to provide a better understanding of STDL (Section~\ref{sec:mem_ana}--\ref{sec:memory_acc_trade}). 
Finally, we examine its generalization ability to different spiking neuron models (Section~\ref{sec:diff_neuron_model}).

