\centering
\includegraphics[width=\textwidth, height = 3.5 in]{architecture_diagram_latest2.png}
\caption{Architecture of the proposed HybridPSOGWO approach for cloud task scheduling, showing the integration of PSO and GWO components with VM-aware task mapping.}
\label{fig:architecture}
