Lemma \ref{lemma:NashGauge} then implies that $x^*=[\sigma]\tilde x^*\in\mc N$ is a Nash equilibrium for the SNC game with binary actions on $\mc G$ with external field $h$. Finally, observe  that $$x^*_{\mc R}=([\sigma]\tilde x^*)_{\mc R}=[\tau]\1=\tau\,,$$
